WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.460 --> 00:00:04.921
You want to let them crash
us into some capital city?

00:00:04.921 --> 00:00:05.964
— Is that it?
— Oh, come on.

00:00:05.964 --> 00:00:08.216
Is that what you think
is going to happen?

00:00:08.216 --> 00:00:09.092
I have no idea.

00:00:09.092 --> 00:00:09.884
No.

00:00:09.884 --> 00:00:11.011
Obviously.

00:00:11.011 --> 00:00:14.514
Yeah, but I'm not going
to wait and find out, am I?

00:00:14.514 --> 00:00:16.433
So what are you going to do?

00:00:16.433 --> 00:00:17.475
You're going to
just attack them?

00:00:17.976 --> 00:00:19.477
No one's asking
you to join in.

00:00:19.477 --> 00:00:21.062
You'll get yourself killed.

00:00:21.062 --> 00:00:26.109
Listen, if you've not got the balls, all you have to do is say.

00:00:26.109 --> 00:00:27.652
Wallets, tablets, devices—

00:01:15.450 --> 00:01:16.242
Water?

00:01:19.621 --> 00:01:20.538
Water?

00:01:20.538 --> 00:01:21.831
Put your table down.

00:01:21.831 --> 00:01:22.624
Sorry?

00:01:25.668 --> 00:01:27.378
Still want sparkling?

00:01:28.505 --> 00:01:29.464
I'm OK.

00:01:29.964 --> 00:01:31.341
Which did you see?

00:01:31.341 --> 00:01:32.133
Water?

00:01:32.133 --> 00:01:34.344
If it was A, do nothing.

00:01:34.344 --> 00:01:36.805
If it was B, and
you're sure it's B—

00:01:36.805 --> 00:01:37.722
Believe me, I won't.

00:01:37.722 --> 00:01:40.141
—turn on your reading light.

00:01:40.725 --> 00:01:42.143
You good?

00:01:43.061 --> 00:01:45.021
Here, have some.

00:01:47.190 --> 00:01:48.108
Take one.

00:01:48.108 --> 00:01:49.150
Thank you. Pass it down.

00:01:49.150 --> 00:01:49.943
Water?

00:01:54.155 --> 00:01:55.115
Water, anyone?

00:01:59.452 --> 00:02:00.161
Water?

00:02:03.706 --> 00:02:04.541
What's up?

00:02:04.541 --> 00:02:05.333
Shh.

00:02:13.258 --> 00:02:14.926
Sky watch, this is Mars.

00:02:15.677 --> 00:02:18.388
We have visual with a
figure mid fuselage.

00:02:18.388 --> 00:02:19.180
Step back.

00:02:25.770 --> 00:02:27.230
Contact is female.

00:02:27.230 --> 00:02:30.066
Agent 130.

00:02:30.066 --> 00:02:31.442
Contact is being attacked.

00:02:31.734 --> 00:02:34.112
Hostage, do not communicate.

00:02:34.737 --> 00:02:35.446
Come with me.

00:02:43.746 --> 00:02:46.749
We need someone to land the plane.

00:02:47.208 --> 00:02:48.459
We're flying around. We.

00:02:48.459 --> 00:02:50.211
You speak Hungarian? Yes. Yeah.

00:02:50.211 --> 00:02:53.173
We need to persuade the Hungarians
to let us land this

00:02:53.798 --> 00:02:55.341
Hungarian air traffic control.

00:02:55.341 --> 00:02:58.303
Speak English.
I know. Don't eat Hungarian.

00:02:58.845 --> 00:03:01.848
We do because the hijackers don't.

00:03:01.973 --> 00:03:05.310
So if you can get a message down
to them in Hungarian,

00:03:05.768 --> 00:03:08.771
this could all be over.

00:03:12.233 --> 00:03:12.859
Pass the scissors.

00:03:19.365 --> 00:03:20.533
Which one was it?

00:03:25.997 --> 00:03:27.207
It was me.

00:03:30.001 --> 00:03:31.127
Right.

00:03:31.127 --> 00:03:32.503
Come here.

00:03:33.463 --> 00:03:35.340
Come here.

00:03:35.340 --> 00:03:36.799
Please!

00:03:39.260 --> 00:03:40.762
Don't look at me.

